Korean Ambiguity Dataset – License Notice
=========================================

This repository contains a dataset constructed by the authors using sentences
sourced from multiple publicly available Korean corpora. The licensing terms
differ between (1) the original source sentences and (2) the annotations,
labels, metadata, and scripts created by the authors.

----------------------------------------------------------------------
1. Original Source Sentences
----------------------------------------------------------------------

This dataset includes raw sentences originating from:

1) NIKL “Part-of-speech Tagged Corpus”
   - License: Research-only / Non-commercial use required
   - Redistribution of any material including original sentences may require
     prior approval from the National Institute of Korean Language.

2) “21st Century Sejong Corpus (Sejong Corpus)”
   - Research-only use permitted
   - Redistribution or reuse of original sentences is subject to the usage
     restrictions of the original provider.

Only the raw sentences were referenced; no morphological tags or annotations
from the source corpora are included in this dataset. Some sentences may
include minor corrections (e.g., typo fixes) performed by the authors for
annotation purposes.

Per-sentence source metadata is NOT included in this release. Users should
therefore assume that the dataset as a whole may contain material derived from
both corpora and must comply with the licensing terms of each source corpus
when redistributing or reusing original text.

----------------------------------------------------------------------
