- NonCommercial — You may NOT use the material for commercial purposes.  
- Indicate changes — You must indicate if changes were made.

License text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/

----------------------------------------------------------------------
3. Summary
----------------------------------------------------------------------

- Raw sentences follow the copyright and usage restrictions of:
    • NIKL Part-of-speech Tagged Corpus (research-only / non-commercial)
    • Sejong Corpus (research-only)

- All annotations and materials CREATED BY THE AUTHORS are licensed under:
    • Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 (CC BY-NC 4.0)

- Users may freely use this dataset for *research and non-commercial* purposes.
  Commercial use of any kind is NOT permitted.

- Users must comply with each source corpus’s licensing terms when redistributing
  or reusing original text.